---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";

export const prerender = true;

const title = "Terms & Conditions | Fuel Calculate";
const description =
  "The terms for using Fuel Calculate's free fuel cost calculator: what the service is, why every figure is an estimate, and the limits of our liability.";
const lastUpdated = "21 July 2026";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: "Home", href: "/" }, { name: "Terms & Conditions", href: "/terms" }]} />
  <Hero eyebrow="Legal" title="Terms & Conditions." lead={`Last updated ${lastUpdated}.`} />

  <section class="mx-auto flex max-w-[720px] flex-col gap-xl px-md pb-5xl sm:px-lg">
    <p class="text-body-md text-body">
      By using Fuel Calculate ("the site", "the service"), you agree to these terms.
      If you don't agree, please don't use the site. We may update these terms from
      time to time — continued use after a change means you accept the updated
      version.
    </p>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">What the service is</h2>
      <p class="mt-sm text-body-md text-body">
        Fuel Calculate is a free tool for estimating trip fuel cost, comparing fuel
        types and vehicles, and projecting monthly fuel spend, across India, the
        United States, the United Kingdom, Canada and Australia. It's provided free
        of charge, with no account required.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Every figure is an estimate — not financial advice</h2>
      <p class="mt-sm text-body-md text-body">
        This is the most important thing to understand before relying on any number
        this site shows you: <strong class="text-ink">every price, mileage, and cost
        figure is an estimate for general informational purposes only.</strong> Fuel
        prices and vehicle mileage vary by location, driving conditions, vehicle
        condition, and time — actual results will differ from what's shown here.
        India's figures draw on ARAI-claimed mileage and automatically-refreshed
        public price sources; the US vehicle list is based on manufacturer/EPA
        figures; the UK, Canada and Australia vehicle and price data are our own
        representative estimates, clearly labelled as such, pending real sourcing for
        those markets. None of this is professional, financial, or automotive advice,
        and none of it should be the sole basis for a purchase decision, a fuel
        switch, a budget commitment, or any other decision with real financial
        consequences — always verify at the pump and against your vehicle's actual
        documented mileage.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">No warranty, "as is" service</h2>
      <p class="mt-sm text-body-md text-body">
        The site is provided "as is" and "as available," without warranties of any
        kind, express or implied, including accuracy, completeness, reliability, or
        fitness for a particular purpose. We don't guarantee the service will be
        uninterrupted, error-free, or available at all times.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p class="mt-sm text-body-md text-body">
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, Fuel Calculate and whoever operates
        it won't be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential loss (for
        example, an incorrect fuel budget, a vehicle purchase decision, or a fuel
        switch you regret) arising from your use of, or inability to use, this site
        or reliance on any figure it shows.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Acceptable use</h2>
      <p class="mt-sm text-body-md text-body">
        Use the site lawfully and don't attempt to disrupt it — no scraping at a rate
        that degrades the service for others, no attempting to bypass its security or
        rate limits, and no reverse-engineering the site to misrepresent its data as
        your own commercial product without permission.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Third-party services</h2>
      <p class="mt-sm text-body-md text-body">
        The site relies on third-party services to work — Cloudflare for hosting,
        ip-api.com for country detection, and Google Maps for the fuel-station
        finder. Your use of those embedded services is also subject to their own
        terms. We aren't responsible for their availability, accuracy, or content.
        See our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-link underline">Privacy Policy</a>
        for how data flows to each of them.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Advertising</h2>
      <p class="mt-sm text-body-md text-body">
        We may display third-party advertising (for example, via Google AdSense) on
        this site in future to help cover its costs. Ads, if shown, are served by
        third-party networks and their presence doesn't imply our endorsement of the
        advertiser or its product.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Changes to the service</h2>
      <p class="mt-sm text-body-md text-body">
        We may add, change, or remove features, or discontinue the site entirely, at
        any time without prior notice.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Governing law</h2>
      <p class="mt-sm text-body-md text-body">
        These terms are governed by the laws of India, without regard to conflict-of-law
        principles, regardless of which country's version of the site you use.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-sm text-body-md text-body">
        Questions about these terms? Email
        <a href="mailto:beststoredeal101@gmail.com" class="text-link underline">beststoredeal101@gmail.com</a>
        or visit the <a href="/contact" class="text-link underline">Contact us</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
